<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90525" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτί̄μ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>honouring before</i> or <i>above</i> others,
				<i>preference</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.82
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.140
			</span></i>; <i>assigning a higher value to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν αὐτῶν ἡ π. καὶ ἡ αἵρεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.7.20
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ προτίμησιν</span> in order
			of <i>importance</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κ. π.
			σχῆμα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλιστα μέν . .
			κτλ</span>.) <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>. (
				Dor.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτίμᾱσις</span> is dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				943.13
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>).)</div>
